---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import achievements from "../../data/achievements.json";

import Related from "../../components/Related.astro";
const sorted = [...achievements].sort((a, b) => (a.title || "").localeCompare(b.title || ""));
---

<Base
  title="Achievement Guide - Dave the Diver - DiverDB"
  description="Dave the Diver achievement guide: full collection, hidden achievements and the most efficient completion order."
>
  <h1>Achievement Guide</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    A practical completion route for the Dave the Diver achievement list ({achievements.length} achievements).
  </p>

  <h2>Plan around the story</h2>
  <p>
    Most achievements unlock naturally while completing main missions, side missions and the
    restaurant ranks. Focus on the story until the Marinca, farm and restaurant systems are open,
    then clean up the collection and cooking achievements in the same runs.
  </p>

  <h2>High-effort achievements</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Fish collection: use the Marinca tracker and check each zone at day and night.</li>
    <li>Recipe collection: buy recipes, complete staff unlocks and watch for event-only dishes.</li>
    <li>Staff collection: hire every available employee and complete their recruitment requirements.</li>
    <li>Boss drops: some achievements need boss ingredients, so keep the unique loot from major fights.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Hidden achievements</h2>
  <p>
    Hidden achievements often reward optional interactions such as photo spots, unusual catch
    methods and DLC-specific activities. Use the side-mission list as a checklist and return to
    completed chapters after unlocking better gear.
  </p>

  <h2>Achievement checklist</h2>
  <div style="overflow-x:auto">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Achievement</th>
          <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {sorted.map((a) => (
          <tr>
            <td><strong>{a.title}</strong></td>
            <td>{a.description || "—"}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>
    Pair the guide with the <a href="/fish/">Fish Database</a>, <a href="/recipes/">Recipe Database</a>
    and <a href="/staff/">Staff Database</a> to track every collectible in one place.
  </p>

  <Related
    heading="Next steps"
    links={[
    { href: "/rankings/", title: "Rankings", sub: "Best fish, dishes, staff and weapons ranked", tool: true },
    { href: "/tools/", title: "Tools", sub: "Planner, filter and compare utilities", tool: true },
  ]}
  />
</Base>
